  m_text: "A mysterious gateway connecting two worlds appears for only 24 hours.
    To enter, you must use an Astral Gate Key. Inside awaits the Gatekeeper - a mighty
    guardian threatening your realm. The stronger the Gatekeeper, the greater the
    challenge\u2026 and the rewards. You can attack every 30 minutes. Battle rankings
    determine your final treasure - only the most relentless will rise to the top
    before the gate vanishes."
